      "label": "A popped batch moves from the inbox to in flight under a lease of {hook_lease} s for a hook or {watcher_lease} s for the watcher. An acknowledgement ends it. An expired lease returns the batch to the inbox, up to {max_redeliveries} times, and the next expiry moves it to the dead-letter list.",
